  "reason": "The best result so far is config_037 (0.7062 accuracy, 0.6671 F1), which extends the strong RNA-only evidence that scvi_n200 with multiprofile avgpool is effective and shows that adding a ViT-L image modality can improve performance. The key untested choice in this top-performing family is fusion: weighted versus concat. config_036 keeps the same strong representation and aggregation settings while changing only fusion to concat, isolating the effect of fusion. With only two experiments remaining, this is a high-value exploitation step: if concat improves accuracy, it directly provides a new best configuration; if not, it confirms weighted fusion and leaves one run to test a different aggregation setting."
